            "description": {
              "value": "You are as at home in the treetops as you are beneath their branches. You gain a climb Speed of 15 feet when moving through trees, vines, and other foliage. Whenever you succeed at an Athletics check to Climb a tree or an Acrobatics check to Balance on a branch, you get a critical success instead. You aren't off-guard while Climbing or Balancing on a tree."
